<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 1.3 Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept base="Anywhere" id="t00867">
	<title>Replacing the front wiper blade</title>
	<conbody>
		<section>
			<title>Operation</title>
			<table>
				<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="1">
					<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
					<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
					<tbody>
						<row>
							<entry colname="col1">
								<fig id="e02752">
									<figgroup>
										<image align="center" href="../../images/N_CT25G011_1.eps" scale="95" placement="break" id="image_lzf_rj3_fjc"/>
									</figgroup>
								</fig>
							</entry>
							<entry colname="col2"/>
						</row>
						<row>
							<entry colname="col1">
								<fig id="e02753">
									<figgroup>
										<image align="center" href="../../images/N_CT25G032_1.eps" scale="95" placement="break"/>
									</figgroup>
								</fig>
							</entry>
							<entry colname="col2">
								<fig id="e02754">
									<figgroup>
										<image align="center" href="../../images/N_CT25G034.eps" scale="95" placement="break"/>
									</figgroup>
								</fig>
							</entry>
						</row>
					</tbody>
				</tgroup>
			</table>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>Turn off the vehicle.</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>Move the wiper switch to the single wiping (<term translate="no">MIST</term> /1x) position within 20 seconds.</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>Hold the wiper switch for more than 2 seconds.</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>Raise the wiper arm.</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>Lift the wiper blade clip up. Pull down the blade assembly and remove it.</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>Install the new blade assembly.</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>Upon starting the vehicle, the wiper arms will return to their normal operating position.</p>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</section>
	</conbody>
</concept>